Help — Dashboard Mode                                                 
                                                                      
  Mode: Normal                                                        
                                                                      
  Actions                                                             
    i                 Browse Issues                                   
    m                 Browse Milestones                               
    M                 Review Milestone                                
    r                 Run Prompt                                      
    a                 Adapt Project                                   
    p                 Review PRs                                      
    S                 Settings                                        
    n                 Release Notes                                   
    R                 Refresh Suggestions                             
                                                                      
  Global keys                                                         
    ⌃K                palette — TurboQuant; on/off in Settings        
    ⌃Q / ⌃X / ⌃C / q  quit — asks first while work is live            
    Tab               next panel                                      
    ⇧Tab              previous panel
